<p>haaye mazdooro&rsquo;n ne kazim asws. ka uthaya laasha.</p>

<p>haaye masooma e qum sa., ne yeh padha hai nauha.</p>

<p> 1. sar pe keelo&rsquo;n ko chubhota tha layee&rsquo;n moula ke.</p>

<p>jaane kis tarha se kazim asws. yeh sitam sehta tha.</p>

<p> 2. taziyano&rsquo;n se rulata tha musalsil sindhi la.,</p>

<p>yaad e sajjad asws. ne kazim asws. ko bohot tadpaya.</p>

<p>3. ghusl dete hue baba ko raza asws., rote hai.</p>

<p>qoon aur zaqmo&rsquo;n mein hai sara badan kazim asws., ka.</p>

<p> 4. baithna bhi bada mushkil tha jaha&rsquo;n kazim asws. ko.</p>

<p>aise zindaan mein zalim la., ne unhe bhijwaya.</p>

<p> 5. betiyo&rsquo;n ki unhe tadpati rahi yaad kumail.    aqri dam bhi labo&rsquo;n par tha faqat masooma sa.</p>